{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Behold, etc.</b> The meaning: they will be able to understand from the sod of prophecy through my deeds and through the names of my sons." "<b>From before YHWH of Hosts.</b> The meaning: for these names were from before HaShem." "<b>Who dwells on Mount Zion.</b> The meaning: because of His abundant love."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:52.420439465Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}